---
globs: functions/src/index.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

when creating new functions in this file, always lazy load the function according to this pattern:

```typescript
export const webhook = functions.https.onRequest(async (request, response) => {
  const { handleWebhook } = await import("./webhook/webhook"); // asynchronously loaded when the https.onRequest trigger happens
  await handleWebhook(request, response); // asynchronously called after code is loaded
});
```
